/// &lt;summary&gt;/// Socket UDP 客户端帮助类/// &lt;/summary&gt;public class UdpClientHelper&#123;    private UdpClient udpClient;    private IPEndPoint serverEndPoint;    private Thread receiveThread;    /// &lt;summary&gt;    /// 收到数据回调    /// &lt;/summary&gt;    public event Action&lt;string&gt; OnDataReceived;    /// &lt;summary&gt;    /// 连接到服务端    /// &lt;/summary&gt;    /// &lt;param name=&quot;ipAddress&quot;&gt;IP&lt;/param&gt;    /// &lt;param name=&quot;port&quot;&gt;端口号&lt;/param&gt;    public void Connect(string ipAddress, int port)    &#123;        serverEndPoint = new IPEndPoint(IPAddress.Parse(ipAddress), port);        udpClient = new UdpClient();        IPEndPoint localEndPoint = new IPEndPoint(IPAddress.Any, 0);        udpClient.Client.Bind(localEndPoint);        receiveThread = new Thread(ReceiveCallback);        receiveThread.Start();    &#125;    /// &lt;summary&gt;    /// 断开连接释放资源    /// &lt;/summary&gt;    public void Disconnect()    &#123;        receiveThread?.Abort();        udpClient?.Close();        udpClient = null;    &#125;    /// &lt;summary&gt;    /// 接收数据回调    /// &lt;/summary&gt;    private void ReceiveCallback()    &#123;        IPEndPoint senderEndPoint = new IPEndPoint(IPAddress.Any, 0);        while (true)        &#123;            try            &#123;                byte[] receivedData = udpClient.Receive(ref senderEndPoint);                string message = Encoding.UTF8.GetString(receivedData);                OnDataReceived?.Invoke(message);            &#125;            catch (SocketException e)            &#123;                // SocketException will be thrown when the thread is aborted or the underlying socket is closed                Console.WriteLine($&quot;UDP receive thread stopped: &#123;e.Message&#125;&quot;);            &#125;        &#125;    &#125;    /// &lt;summary&gt;    /// 发送消息    /// &lt;/summary&gt;    /// &lt;param name=&quot;data&quot;&gt;消息&lt;/param&gt;    public void SendData(string data)    &#123;        byte[] sendData = Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes(data);        udpClient.Send(sendData, sendData.Length, serverEndPoint);    &#125;&#125;

